BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Acme Robotics - Security Policy \(2026\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (Section 1. Passwords) Tj T* (All employee passwords must be at least 14 characters long.) Tj T* (Passwords must be rotated every 180 days and may not be reused.) Tj T* (Multi-factor authentication \(MFA\) is mandatory for VPN and email access.) Tj T* (Accounts are locked for 15 minutes after 5 failed login attempts.) Tj T* ET
endstream
