stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Section 2. Incident response) Tj T* (Security incidents must be reported to security@acme.example within 1 hour of discovery.) Tj T* (The on-call security engineer triages incidents and opens a post-mortem within 5 business days.) Tj T* (Customer data breaches are escalated to the legal team immediately.) Tj T* (Lost or stolen laptops must be reported to the IT helpdesk on the same day.) Tj T* ET
endstream
