<< /Length 459 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Section 3. Devices and data) Tj T* (All laptops must use full-disk encryption and lock the screen after 5 minutes of inactivity.) Tj T* (Confidential data may only be stored on company-managed devices and approved cloud storage.) Tj T* (USB storage devices are blocked on company laptops unless an exception is approved by security.) Tj T* (Data is classified as Public, Internal, Confidential or Strictly Confidential.) Tj T* ET
endstream
