stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Section 4. Backups and vendors) Tj T* (Production databases are backed up every 6 hours and backups are kept for 35 days.) Tj T* (Backup restore tests are performed every quarter.) Tj T* (Vendors receive time-limited access accounts that expire after 90 days.) Tj T* (Vendor access to production systems requires approval from the system owner.) Tj T* ET
endstream
